From: OpenHarmony Compile Agent
Subject: [PATCH] sdl2_mixer 2.8.1 - No additional patches required

This patch file serves as documentation that sdl2_mixer 2.8.1's source
code already builds on OHOS (OpenHarmony) without source modifications.

Adaptation is done entirely via CMake configure options in the conan
recipe (conanfile.py generate()):
- BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF (static library)
- SDL2MIXER_OPUS/VORBIS/FLAC/MOD/MIDI/WAVPACK/GME/CMD=OFF (drop
  optional audio formats, keep WAV + MP3 via bundled minimp3)
- SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR/SDL2_LIBRARY injected for FindPrivateSDL2.cmake
- CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=Linux (E092: CMake lacks HarmonyOS platform module)

Build details:
- Build system: cmake
- Target: aarch64 (OHOS)
- Compiler: clang/clang++
- No source modifications needed

Signed-off-by: OpenHarmony Compile Agent <compile-agent@opendesk.org>
---
 (no files modified; documentation only)
